# CONTROL HOOK - run after a power or control action on a node
#
#        nine defined methods are mandatory, each takes nodename and groupname
#        and returns <True|False>,"message":
#        - power_on
#        - power_off
#        - power_reset
#        - power_cycle
#        - power_status
#        - identify
#        - no_identify
#        - sel_list
#        - sel_clear
#
# The hook runs once the control plugin has acted, whatever that returned.

# Plugin selection based on the following search path and priority:
#
# 1 node name                 e.g. plugins/hooks/control/node001.py
# 2 group name                e.g. plugins/hooks/control/compute.py
# 3 default                   e.g. plugins/hooks/control/default.py
